olegkoskin","html_url":"https://github.com/olegkoskin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olegkoskin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olegkoskin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olegkoskin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olegkoskin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olegkoskin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olegkoskin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olegkoskin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olegkoskin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olegkoskin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-15T09:19:20Z","updated_at":"2026-06-15T09:19:20Z","body":"+1 \nIt's 2026, but Spanner Emulator still doesn't support `OPTIMIZER_VERSION` hint.\nI get an error:\n`Caused by: com.google.cloud.spanner.SpannerException: INVALID_ARGUMENT: io.grpc.StatusRuntimeException: INVALID_ARGUMENT: Unsupported hint: OPTIMIZER_VERSION.`","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GoogleCloudPlatform/cloud-spanner-emulator/issues/comments/4706389627/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GoogleCloudPlatform/cloud-spanner-emulator/issues/comments/4775056520","html_url":"https://github.com/GoogleCloudPlatform/cloud-spanner-emulator/issues/300#issuecomment-4775056520","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GoogleCloudPlatform/cloud-spanner-emulator/issues/300","id":4775056520,"node_id":"IC_kwDODvxg1s8AAAABHJ2UiA","user":{"login":"KaguraGateway","id":32214018,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjE0MDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32214018?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaguraGateway","html_url":"https://github.com/KaguraGateway","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaguraGateway/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaguraGateway/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaguraGateway/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaguraGateway/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaguraGateway/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaguraGateway/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaguraGateway/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaguraGateway/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaguraGateway/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-23T02:27:27Z","updated_at":"2026-06-23T02:27:27Z","body":"I noticed that the `scan_method` table hint is listed as supported in this issue, but the value `columnar` is not accepted — the emulator rejects it with an error, while production Spanner handles it gracefully.\n\nEmulator version: v1.5.54\nError: `Invalid hint value for: scan_method hint: \"columnar\".`\n\nFor additional context: `columnar_policy` DDL support was added in v1.5.52 (`ALTER TABLE ... SET OPTIONS (columnar_policy = 'enabled')` is accepted), but the corresponding query hint `@{scan_method=columnar}` is rejected at query time.\nOn production Spanner, the hint is silently ignored when `columnar_policy` is not enabled on the target table.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GoogleCloudPlatform/cloud-spanner-emulator/issues/comments/4775056520/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]]